ugh for me. You came through for everyone.\n\nThanks, mate.',27980),(53074,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Your new recruits will be available for missions once they have finished their training.',27980),(51715,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am sure Falstad will handle this mission with his usual grace.',27980),(51568,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work! These look great!$b$bThese bars will be used as part of our next warship.$b$bNow then, you scratched my back, and I will scratch yours. Storm silver is very brittle naturally. When you mine it, use several small swings instead of one big one. That\'ll keep the metal from being chipped away.',27980),(48752,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks! You can never be too careful when it comes to breathing thick clouds of smoke from burning coal and molten metal.$b$bNow I owe you a lesson about monelite. Let\'s see, what to teach...$b$bWhen you\'re mining monelite, instead of chipping away at the rock, try using the pick to pierce the metal, and pull all of it away from the rock like it was taffy.',27980),(50249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We finally got some useful information from him?',27980),(49734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. That should be enough help to get my men back in that fort and manning it again.',27980),(49716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A grim task, but one that needed to be done.',27980),(49720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My birds deserve better partners than men who betray their own country.',27980),(49733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My gratitude, that should help alleviate some of the soldiers\' pain.',27980),(51226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s one problem dealt with.',27980),(49715,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A courier? I think we lost him in the coup.',27980),(49302,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My inadequacy to rule lead to Deepwarden\'s near takeover of not only the fishing operation here, but the village as a whole.$b$bI can no longer allow myself to sit quietly and allow people like him to walk over me to do as they please! I\'ve learned that, thanks to you.',27980),(48370,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps now the 