e up house cat, it gets rough from here on out.',27980),(51384,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, you got the saurok.\n\nBilge Rats should be out of here soon enough.',27980),(48009,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did what needed to be done.',27980),(48365,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alby clears his throat.>$b$bIt is good to see the young lord safe.$b$b...Thanks.',27980),(48356,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This has never been a simple illness. There is foul magic at work here.',27980),(48008,396,0,0,0,300,0,0,0,'All we can do now is try to contain the threat.',27980),(49299,396,0,0,0,300,0,0,0,'Bates gave everything he had for greater power. Shame it had to go that way.',27980),(48354,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am... aghast. How could this happen right under our very noses?',27980),(48355,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If there is even a chance of harm to innocents, we must protect them at all cost.',27980),(48353,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In the name of the sea! Did you see that?',27980),(49292,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In all my days, I have never seen such an illness. We must find the source!',27980),(48348,4,1,0,0,0,300,0,0,'Well throw me a hammer and call me Nancy!$b$bThank you kindly pal. This should be plenty! I\'ll get to work!',27980),(49268,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unfortunate... the tides still speak the same.',27980),(48352,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glorious! This should be plenty.',27980),(48540,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No seaweed? This will not do at all!',27980),(48347,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! Are you here because of my posting?$b$bThank the sea, I need all the able-bodied help I can get.',27980),(51367,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You defeated the revenant! Bully! Well done as always, my friend!',27980),(47755,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My men have been reporting back to me. Thanks for freeing them, $n.',27980),(50005,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found my precious little sea star!',27980),(50059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I decided if you can\'t beat \'em, join \'em! That one over there looks available. Think she\'ll go out with me?$B$BOh, and thanks for getting everyone back at their posts. We got a lot of cleanup.',27980),(50002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Where\'s my dad? I\'m hungry. Can I have a sword? Where\'s my dad?!',27980),(50026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We need your help, sailor!',27980),(48903,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He\'s on! He\'s on!$b$bDon\'t worry, $n. I\'m sure he\'ll be fine! Thanks for all of your help!',27980),(48898,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think I can feel the luck too!',27980),(48902,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh boy oh boy! He\'s gonna be pumped!',27980),(48899,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, these shells will help keep me well safeguarded!',27980),(49036,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a showing!',27980),(48089,1,1,0,0,0,300,0,0,'Our people defend the estate with renewed vigor!',27980),(48088,1,11,0,0,0,300,0,0,'A grand showing! You had me on the edge of my seat!',27980),(48087,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t believe I\'m saying this, $n, but troggs are invading the estate!',27980),(48939,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a showing!',27980),(48004,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n! I think you\'re ready to take it to the next level!',27980),(48005,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How are you enjoying the grounds? We are still setting up, so it will be even more marvelous soon!$b$bTo tell you the truth, I have to one-up myself every year. It\'s quite exhausting organizing it all, but it\'s so very rewarding!',27980),(48003,1,11,0,0,0,300,0,0,'You\'re $n? The hero that saved my son from the troggs?$b$bHohoho! You are very welcome at my estate! You must regale me with your tales of your gallant rescue!',27980),(48597,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Troggs training saurolisks to be ridden? Seems they\'ve learned from watching us after all.$b$bIt\'s better that you freed them. I don\'t particularly want to imagine what would happen if the troggs were widely successful in their new riding endeavors!',27980),(48195,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fewer troggs means fewer of our people getting attacked.',27980),(48778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The soup has somehow taken on a somewhat floral quality. It feels well-balanced on the tongue and goes down very smoothly.$b$bThis may be, in fact, the most delicious cuisine you have ever tasted.',27980),(48196,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved me! Those troggs are really scary. They took Hotshot and dragged me through their camp!',27980),(48670,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How could this get any worse?$b$bThe troggs have captured Eddie!',27980),(48965,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Caleb\'s body is lifeless, still warm. His wounds claimed him while you were gone.$b$bHis face seems content, as though he knew you would finish the job.>',27980),(48077,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not only will these pelts please the nobles, they also prove your worth as a hunter.',27980),(48616,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s nothing like man and beast working together for a clean hunt!',27980),(48080,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Harold lets out a hardy laugh.>$b$bNow that\'s what I\'m talking about!',27980),(48070,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, traveler! Care to join in the hunt?',27980),(52258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oooh! These are so pretty! I bet they\'ll sell really well.',27980),(49229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve fought off spirits afore, but ne\'er the actual ruins themselves.',27980),(49234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I heard the falling of stone echo through the cave from here. Nice work.',27980),(49260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Everything worth our attention should be stored in my bag, many thanks.',27980),(49225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yer here to help? Finally!',27980),(49233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another victory for druid magic! This staff is much more effective than any of Cranklefuse\'s gadgets.',27980),(49232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t wait to see what sort of power I can squeeze out of these.',27980),(51151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We might have a wee problem on our hands.',27980),(49467,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Maynard studies the locket.>$b$bThat ungrateful woman!',27980),(49450,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have never seen beasts so... soulless. It\'s as if they\'re under some sort of spell.',27980),(49454,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for that.$b$bI uh... I think you got some spider egg goop on your cloak.',27980)