u?',27980),(52431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you, thank you so much!',27980),(49405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve come to help? Oh, thank the tides.',27980),(49404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m so sorry, $p. I came as fast as I could!',27980),(49409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This diamond must have been among the mysterious outlaw\'s cache of dried meats and other \"treasures.\"$B$BYou carefully remove it from the dog poo.>',27980),(49400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! That oughtta slow \'em down, or at least piss \'em off.',27980),(49399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I--I\'ll try to make sense of these.$B$BYou\'ve gotta help Flynn!',27980),(49522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As your head clears up, you see gold pieces scattered about the room.>',27980),(49407,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You actually did it? Color me impressed.',27980),(49401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, now that the boss is updated, let\'s get back to work.',27980),(49403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'ll teach \'em!',27980),(49402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! So many pretties came back!',27980),(49290,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh! The bourbon from that turtle fellow!$B$BSo... he\'s not coming himself? And I take it you\'re no Irontide loyalist.$B$BVery well, hand it over.',27980),(49398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, nothing like sharing a drink with an old friend... and a new one!',27980),(49239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry, Venrik\'s a good man. I trust him with my life.',27980),(52544,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have gathered enough resources to begin the assault on Zandalar.',27980),(48558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just as I thought - Irontide cut some kind of deal with Ashvane.$B$BFigures... birds of a feather and all that.',27980),(48773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work! This is undeniable proof that Priscilla has been selling weapons to pirates.$B$BIt\'s high treason!',27980),(48776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, there she is! Good show.$B$BWhaddya say to a toast?',27980),(48774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha!$B$B<Geraldine spits again out of her tooth gap.>$B$BHad it comin\' they did!',27980),(48606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Better to destroy these new weapons than to let them fall into the wrong hands.>',27980),(48539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ready to head face-first into a den of snakes?',27980),(44719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must commend your knack for overcoming adversity. Take your time gathering your fellow champions, $n, but don\'t take TOO long!',27980),(44964,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The preparations are nearly complete. Oculeth will be ready to teleport us soon.',27980),(45269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very well. Let us begin.',27980),(45064,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our efforts have proven quite successful. I believe we are just about ready to make our stand.',27980),(45062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oculeth will be quite pleased with your findings. As you know, he\'s been working diligently on a new device for the withered.',27980),(45066,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! Now the fun begins. You should speak with Thalyssra, I believe she is ready for more... testing.',27980),(45063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The withered seem to be adapting quite well.',27980),(45065,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will begin analyzing this data at once.$B$BFor now, let us turn our attention to more... <Oculeth touches his fingertips together in succession.>$B$B...interesting technological advances.',27980),(45067,25,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us begin.',27980),(44919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The withered... defeated so easily.$B$BWe must find a way to negate the magic of the felborne. We cannot afford to fight if our own can be turned against us.',27980),(44918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I do not know what lies in store for us, but we cannot sit idly while Ly\'leth is missing.$B$BWe must act now!',27980),(45268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad we can still cure my people, but... I have troubling news.',27980),(44833,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valtrois told me everything. She is hard at work on a plan for bringing down that barrier.$B$BI am afraid all we can do for now is wait. Thank you for your help.',27980),(44832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It appears Ly\'leth was correct. This is an entrance to the Nightwell - and it i