INSERT INTO `quest_request_items` VALUES (26797,0,0,0,0,'Leave me be...',0),(26795,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t blame you if you\'re having trouble with him, $n. Some of our strongest Watchers have been lost to Mor\'Ladim.',0),(26693,0,0,0,0,'I hear you loud and clear, $n.',0),(26640,6,0,0,0,'They got Brubaker?',0),(26636,1,0,0,0,'Leaves and poop - that\'s what I need.',0),(26637,6,0,0,0,'Did you recover the glands?',0),(26607,6,0,0,0,'You again?',0),(26573,0,0,0,0,'Did you locate the headband and amulet?',0),(26569,6,0,0,0,'Did you recover the spyglasses?',0),(26562,5,0,0,0,'Well look at that! The team\'s all here... everyone but Keeshan.',0),(26560,0,0,0,0,'Messner! Damn, it\'s good to see a friendly face. Get me out of here!',0),(26587,6,0,0,0,'Did you get the cage key?',0),(26571,0,0,0,0,'Did you terminate Murdunk and Homurk?',0),(26545,6,0,0,0,'Do you have the Blackrock invasion plans?',0),(26513,6,0,0,0,'Did you recover the supplies?\n',0),(26544,6,0,0,0,'What have you found out?',0),(26514,6,0,0,0,'Did you recover those collars?',0),(26510,6,0,0,0,'Have you recovered the gnomecorder?',0),(26508,24,0,0,0,'Hi.  I miss my necklace.  My daddy got it for me.  Daddy says that there are monsters in the lake.  Did you beat up any monsters?',0),(26509,6,0,0,0,'Is Bellygrub still at it or were you able to rid Lakeshire of the pest once and for all?',0),(26505,6,0,0,0,'Where did I put my monocle?! Conacher is that you?',0),(26503,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the gnoll plans?',0),(26506,6,0,0,0,'Have you gotten my ingredients?',0),(26230,396,0,0,0,'Dirt pies don\'t make themselves - usually.',0),(26152,6,0,0,0,'Turning in a bounty?',0),(27199,0,0,0,0,'You will find them to the east, $n.  Do not fail me.',25928),(27172,0,0,0,0,'Did Valorfist send you?  He doesn\'t know when to let up, does he?',0),(27171,0,0,0,0,'What happened at Uther\'s Tomb, $n?',0),(27167,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve traveled a long way.  Anything you can spare would be appreciated.',0),(27166,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you back, $n.',0),(27164,0,0,0,0,'Araj is a formidable opponent.  Be prepared.',0),(26809,0,0,0,0,'You have not done as I asked, $r.  Perhaps I was wrong to have selected you for this task...',25928),(26825,0,0,0,0,'You got something that needs mixing?',0),(26192,6,0,0,0,'Were you able to find the confectioners\' sugar?',0),(28416,0,0,0,0,'You have trouble finding them?  They\'re to the south, $n.',25950),(44558,0,0,0,0,'Did you teach \'em a lesson?',25961),(27354,1,0,0,0,'Did you bring the materials I\'ll need for your weapon?',0),(24611,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. Did you have something for me?',0),(24610,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. Did you have something for me?',0),(33514,0,0,0,0,'Quickly $n, you must stop the ritual!  Amnennar cannot be allowed to return.',25961),(30998,0,0,0,0,'Have you collected the insignia?',0),(31493,1,0,0,0,'It\'s imperative that I get my hands on the codex.',0),(25770,0,0,0,0,'Aye? What\'ve you got for me there?',0),(25395,6,0,0,0,'Do you have it? Is the poor thing intact?',0),(27016,0,1,0,0,'It\'s okay, $n. It happens to a lot of $cs. Being unable to live up to my greatness is nothing to be ashamed of.',25961),(26176,0,0,0,0,'What can I do for you?',0),(26145,6,0,0,0,'Do you have eight trogg stone teeth to show me?  If not, there is still work to be done, $n.',0),(26112,1,0,0,0,'What is the meaning of this intrusion?',0),(24609,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. Did you have something for me?',0),(29352,6,0,0,0,'The chickens, $n, do ye have them or not?',0),(25840,0,1,0,0,'Did you find and kill Battok the Berserker?',25961),(26170,0,0,0,0,'Quickly, friend.  This is but the calm before the storm.',25961),(27325,1,0,0,0,'The tauren love their drums. I can only imagine the Drums of War will be somehow different from the others.',0),(27320,1,0,0,0,'We\'ll need the actual writ, not just any tauren scroll hanging.',0),(27316,1,0,0,0,'That\'s the fabled Rattle of Bones, $n!',0),(25873,6,0,0,0,'What\'s this, $c?',0),(25825,6,0,0,0,'What\'s this? Is that oil?!',0),(28031,6,0,0,0,'That\'s not what I think it is? Is it?!',0),(25627,6,0,0,0,'What\'s going on? You gonna get me out of here?',0),(25609,6,6,0,0,'Oh gosh, do you already have all of that sunken treasure?',25996),(25778,33,0,0,0,'What\'s this? That is a lot of gold you have there.',0),(25774,1,0,0,0,'Once you return with enough of that pyrite, we\'ll give it a once over with a paint brush, pile it all up on a pallet, and send you back up with it to the chieftain.',0),(25756,6,0,0,0,'Do you have the Horde\'s proposal? What are they offering for the drilling rights?',0),(25515,274,0,0,0,'I\'m not punching the timecard on this one until you get me everything that\'s on that parts list.',0),(25524,0,0,0,0,'Oh, for the love of the Light, do you have that crowbar yet? Drowning here!',25996),(25504,6,0,0,0,'Is that the list of parts, finally? I\'ve been waiting all day for that!',0),(29032,1,0,0,0,'We must get the saber cubs while they\'re still young enough to bond with people. If they get too old, the cats will remain feral forever.',0),(28523,0,1,0,0,'You\'ve certainly earned my trust, $n, but you may need to continue to earn the trust of my untrusting tribe.  There is something you can do to earn that trust.$B$BThe Winterfall are known to carry spirit beads to ward against foul spirits.  These beads have clearly failed in their purpose, as the Winterfall themselves are the agents of corruption.  Bring to me these spirit beads from fallen Winterfall furbolgs; for every set of five you bring me, you will earn recognition amongst the Timbermaw.',0),(13644,0,33,0,0,'The harbinger yet lives, $n. I cannot begin to cleanse Lake Falathim until it is slain.',25996),(13506,6,0,0,0,'Yes, $c?',0),(13596,0,0,0,0,'Have you obtained the plans yet, $n?',0),(13591,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back! I hear the battle went well.',0),(13569,0,0,0,0,'The great spirits have been here longer than I can remember. They were once mortal animals if all the stories are true, and they died in time of dire fates.',25996),(28529,6,0,0,0,'How can I help you, $c?',0),(25451,6,0,0,0,'What\'s this, $n - you\'ve got something special for me?',0),(26401,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back... and without him...',0),(25394,0,1,0,0,'A dragon corrupted is a terrible threat. This must be done!',25996),(27429,1,0,0,0,'Have you put that torch to good use?',0),(27242,1,0,0,0,'Did you capture those raptors?',0),(27427,1,0,0,0,'Did you get those weapons from Blackhoof Village?',0),(27426,1,0,0,0,'Were you able to find any trace of the orders?',0),(27284,6,0,0,0,'Something for me to look at?',0),(27263,6,0,0,0,'Have you found anything of interest at the Shady Rest Inn?',0),(27252,6,0,0,0,'Have you found evidence from the site of the Shady Rest Inn?',0),(27247,0,0,0,0,'You have something for me?',0),(27246,0,0,0,0,'Do you have a report to make?',0),(27237,1,0,0,0,'Did your search of the wreckage reveal anything about the Defias cargo?',0),(27236,1,0,0,0,'Let\'s see what you managed to \"borrow\" from the Defias.',0),(27235,1,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. What brings you out here?',0),(27234,1,1,0,0,'Were you able to track down their leader?',25996),(27212,1,0,0,0,'I thought I heard laughter coming from the barracks. Did you distribute those leaflets I gave you?',0),(27220,1,0,0,0,'Remember, the deal is \"don\'t come back until something bites you.\"',0),(27211,1,0,0,0,'Did you manage to find and capture the remaining propaganda leaflets?',0),(27218,1,0,0,0,'What\'ll it be today? The snook is quite good.',0),(27217,1,1,0,0,'Were you able to get any of that thresher oil?',25996),(27210,0,1,0,0,'Have you driven the deserter agents from Theramore?',25996),(28398,0,1,0,0,'Have you managed to capture the pyromancer\'s grimoire?',0),(24597,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $c. Did you have something for me?',0),(27103,0,1,0,0,'With the Sealed Reliquary of Purity in our possession, it will be possible not only to remove a corrupting threat from the world but also to study it under our judicious watch.  Perhaps we can even devise new means to combat the taint of corruption that ever threatens Azeroth.',0),(37445,1,0,0,0,'When we have those spare parts, I know that we\'ll get this emitter repaired. With any luck there will be someone else out there left to talk to.',0),(37444,1,0,0,0,'The more we can do to clear up Nestlewood, the faster Zhanaa can get back to work.',0),(25421,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back! What have you found?',0),(25565,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the tablets?',0),(25065,0,0,0,0,'Do be careful with the contents of the chest.',0),(25063,0,0,0,0,'Hopefully your spree of turtle destruction left it intact.',0),(25062,0,0,0,0,'What have you found?',0),(12301,0,6,0,0,'Is it done?',26365),(11698,0,1,0,0,'There\'s no way that you could have killed so many Scourge in such a short time!',26365),(11694,0,1,0,0,'Time\'s wasting, $c. The last thing we need is to have to face plagued magnataur.$B$BThe normal ones are bad enough as it is!',26365),(11693,0,1,0,0,'Doesn\'t look like enough of the plagued magnataur have been put down yet, $c.$B$BThink you could take care of a few more before coming back?',26365),(29613,0,0,0,0,'Is Kalithresh dead? Please tell me he didn\'t escape.',26365),(29615,0,0,0,0,'Did you dispatch of the water thief?',26365),(29654,0,0,0,0,'Have you returned with proof of \'Warchief\' Kargath Bladefist\'s demise?',0),(29656,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring me the cloth?',0),(29649,0,0,0,0,'Did you bring the ember? We don\'t have much time!',0),(11414,0,0,0,0,'<A low growl rises from Ulfang\'s throat.>$B$BBjomolf and Varg are not dead!',26654),(11489,0,6,0,0,'Fits like a glove, don\'t it?',26654),(11477,0,1,0,0,'You\'ll need to kill until you\'ve had your fill.',26654),(11430,0,6,0,0,'Have you taken care of Yavus?',26654),(12807,0,397,0,0,'I suppose you think that you\'re ready to continue? How could you be though... you haven\'t yet heard the entirety of my tale!',26822),(13046,0,0,0,0,'',26822),(12879,1,0,0,0,'Someone is using the Forge of Wills to create this army... Ulduar is no longer safe. $R, did you recover the core?',0),(12864,0,0,0,0,'Any sign of\'m?',26822),(24587,0,1,0,0,'Ignis is not yet dead. The fire giant must fall!',26822),(12138,0,1,0,0,'How\'s the charging going?',26822),(11284,0,1,0,0,'Have you had any luck removing that stupid yeti from my mine?',26822),(11235,0,1,0,0,'I want those filthy creatures dead! They threaten us all over the fjord, and it\'s high time we put a stop to them by wiping them out at Ssssshhhhhalerbron.$B$B<The captain says the name of the vrykul fortress derisively.>',26822),(11330,0,6,0,0,'Well? How\'d it go ...hic?',26822),(13338,0,1,0,0,'Have you crippled Corp\'rethar\'s defenders?',26899),(29141,0,0,0,0,'Even with such monstrous opponents marching upon them, not a single one of my men has quit the field. Jarod is to be commended. He inspires the men like no other.',26972),(25499,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',26972),(29200,0,0,0,0,'Hamuul really shouldn\'t worry about the affairs of a lone druid. The hour of our attack is at hand!',26972),(29149,0,0,0,0,'There isn\'t time to waste, $r.',26972),(29195,0,0,0,0,'Continue the fight, $n. Only a short while longer now.',26972),(25352,0,6,0,0,'The battle heats up! How goes it?',26972),(25278,0,1,0,0,'Gar\'gol isn\'t exactly the brightest torch on the mountain, if you know what I mean.',26972),(25564,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to secure that equipment, $c?',27101),(25545,0,0,0,0,'Have you recovered our gear, $r?',27101),(25546,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to find anything for my men and I to eat, $c?',27101),(25357,0,0,0,0,'Have you given the naga something to think about, $c?',27101),(25281,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to rescue the soldiers, $r?$b$bWe will perish without their help...',27101),(25888,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to rescue some of the imprisoned soldiers, $n?',27178),(25885,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to find me any of their seaweed, $c?',27178),(28497,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t think twice, $n.$b$bThese guys are rotten to the core.',27219),(28351,0,0,0,0,'Did you capture the Pygmies I need, friend?',27219),(26132,0,1,0,0,'There are still more fiends to be destroyed.',27219),(26070,0,25,0,0,'I\'m going to need you to kill a few more of those things. The shamans here are very particular about it. You\'d think they were druids.',27219),(25975,6,6,0,0,'How much plunder have you managed to reclaim, $n?',27219),(25977,0,6,0,0,'It\'s done then?',27219),(25950,0,1,0,0,'This one\'s not bright and breezy, love, but when they\'re brown bread, we\'ll have ourselves a good tumble down the sink, you and I.$B$BRight?',27219),(25981,6,6,0,0,'How many you got?',27219),(26080,0,0,0,0,'Have you found Oskar and Humphrey?',0),(26019,0,0,0,0,'What\'ve ya got there, $n?',0),(26017,0,0,0,0,'How many did ya catch?',27219),(26018,0,0,0,0,'Ya gotta get back out there, $n.  Cap\'n needs this recon, and he\'s counting on me!',27219),(26015,0,0,0,0,'We need enough phosphora to make a really bright light, especially if you\'re going to be competing with those murlocs.',27219),(26106,0,0,0,0,'We haven\'t found the right combination yet, $n.  Keep at it!  I\'m sure you can figure it out!',27219),(26103,0,0,0,0,'How did the device work, $n?',27219),(25860,0,0,0,0,'I am trusting you to safeguard us, Battlemaiden.',27219),(25626,0,1,0,0,'The ruins are surely still swarming with naga. Pay close attention to their patrols and I\'m sure you\'ll be able to slip through.',27219),(25894,0,1,0,0,'These scroungers seem intensely curious about our equipment. Sometimes suicidally so. I wonder what attracts them to it so much.',27219),(25897,0,0,0,0,'The rope ties the whole plan together!',27219),(25895,0,0,0,0,'A whole big box of amazing! That\'s what it is. I need more amazing in my life.$B$BDon\'t worry, I\'ll share.',27219),(25755,0,1,0,0,'I know it\'s a hard request to head - a whim in a time of dire consequences. You just have to trust me. More than anything right know, we need to know why the naga are here and what they are capable of.',27219),(25754,0,6,0,0,'Any word... on their numbers?',27219),(25753,0,1,0,0,'These guys aren\'t in good shape. We may need to retreat sooner than we\'d like.',27219),(25752,0,1,0,0,'Speak to Enginner Hexascrub to secure a mount for the assault.',27219),(25751,5,5,0,0,'Tick, tock, tick, tock. Always in such a hurry. No time for innovation. What I wouldn\'t give for a lab again!',27219),(25749,0,0,0,0,'Finished already?',27219),(25748,0,0,0,0,'They\'re amassing infantry to the south.$B$BWe need more time. Do anything you can to clear them out.',27219),(25760,0,6,0,0,'That took longer than expected. Did you learn anything useful? Who did the blade belong to?',27219),(27716,1,0,0,0,'Hah! Did you see the admiral giving me dirty looks and decide to throw some sympathy my way? I\'ve pretty much lost hope of making him understand that these ruins offer us some opportunity to salvage some usefulness out of this whole mess.$B$BI\'d actually hoped that you might turn up again - you seem like the only one I can rely on. Wait... what\'s that you have there?',0),(25583,6,0,0,0,'Yes, $c?',0),(25579,0,1,0,0,'This is a matter of life and death, $c. The longer we wait, the more we risk giving away our position.',27219),(25582,0,0,0,0,'We are not hard to find in this cave. We will need to strike quickly - before the naga start searching for us.',27219),(25580,0,1,0,0,'It seems clear that they do not take us seriously, which actually worries me. We have no idea how many of these naga there really are. As time passes, I grow to fear that the shell we escaped was only a small piece of a very large puzzle.',27219),(25581,0,1,0,0,'Let\'s keep the Admiral out of this, shall we? That man has only vengeance on his mind, and his eyes are locked forward. The past is meaningless to him.',27219),(25540,1,0,0,0,'You look to have come back to us with purpose. Was your trip successful?',0),(25538,0,0,0,0,'Fishy companions for all!',27219),(25537,0,5,0,0,'These chemicals are of utmost importance to my defensive diving strategies. Delay not, for we all all in murloc-laced peril!',27219),(25539,6,6,0,0,'Has your clam-laden frolic proved fruitful?',27219),(25536,0,0,0,0,'Let me know if you get things taken care of down there. We\'re stretched pretty thin and I\'m getting worried about the safety of the divers.',27219),(25920,0,0,0,0,'The naga must have some ulterior motive with these pearls.  If I had time to study them, I\'m certain I could figure it out.',27219),(25918,0,0,0,0,'In my youth, I was given some training on spearfighting.$b$b\"Stick them with the pointy end,\" I think it was.',27219),(25919,0,0,0,0,'You\'d better keep trying, $n.  These naga aren\'t going anywhere unless you wake the creature up.',27219),(25916,0,0,0,0,'The ritual is not yet complete, $n.',27219),(25909,0,0,0,0,'I hope this works.  My skills as a shaman are limited, and I fear that this task may be too much for us.',27219),(27687,0,0,0,0,'You took down that Sea Giant, $c?',0),(27042,0,5,0,0,'Yer gonna have ta do better than that, $g laddie : missy;!$B$BNow get back up there an\' finish the job or do I have ta go an\' do it myself?',27291),(27006,0,6,0,0,'What\'d ya see? What are those cheese lovers up ta?',27291),(29328,0,0,0,0,'My Go\'el cannot tread these waters forever, $n!',27291),(29327,0,0,0,0,'Stay vigilant, $n! Do not give up on Go\'el.',27291),(29670,0,0,0,0,'We are ready to fight the mogu leader whenever you are.',27326),(29587,0,0,0,0,'Those ropes should give with a strong tug.',27326),(29580,0,0,0,0,'Were there any tools left?',27326),(29585,0,0,0,0,'Best not to judge our prized cider by its flavor in this state.',27326),(31319,0,0,0,0,'My thoughts will be with your companions, $n.$b$bMay they be made whole again soon.',27326),(30502,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the jade, $n?',27326),(30500,0,0,0,0,'This, it seems, is only the tip of the iceberg, $n.',27326),(30568,0,0,0,0,'Is everyone in order and ready to move?',27326),(30565,0,0,0,0,'Did ye find my missing gears and bolts?',27326),(30005,0,0,0,0,'I love to see fireworks lighting up the sky!',27326),(29999,0,0,0,0,'I hope they didn\'t give you too much trouble.',27326),(30001,0,0,0,0,'I can see the moths eating the pages from here!',27326),(30002,0,0,0,0,'My stomach is too fragile to handle the squashing of bugs. Is it done?',27326),(29997,0,0,0,0,'The pools are clouded. I will need my staff to calm the spirits and speak to the water.',27326),(30495,0,0,0,0,'Did you deliver the jade in time?',27326),(30140,0,0,0,0,'The wild cloud serpents live in a delicate balance with nature. Their rare eggs are quite vulnerable to enemies.',0),(30137,0,0,0,0,'The saurok keep the stolen serpent eggs in their camp.',27326),(30136,0,0,0,0,'Did you return the hatchlings to their nests?',27326),(30135,0,0,0,0,'The Order rarely meddles with the natural balance on this island, but it is too important to save the serpents.',27326),(29624,0,0,0,0,'What are you waiting for?',27326),(29637,0,0,0,0,'Good luck, $n.',27326),(29631,0,0,0,0,'Please, do not speak of our arrangement with others. My cowardice shames me.',27326),(29630,0,0,0,0,'Very recently, I was walking in the Waxwood, when one of these sprites got on all fours behind my knees, evading my notice. Soon afterward, a second sprite approached me from the front, shoving me forcefully in the chest. Unaware of the first sprite, I stepped backwards, only to stumble on his prostrate form and fall, embarrassingly, onto my backside.$b$bSo yes, I have a vested interest in this assignment.',27326),(29629,0,0,0,0,'It is said that the ancient herbalism masters were able to remove 20 vials of extract from each blossom.',27326),(29628,0,0,0,0,'She really is a nice woman. And an excellent cook.$b$bThe best cook in the world, actually.',27326),(29627,0,0,0,0,'<Wu looks at you expectantly.>',27326),(29635,0,0,0,0,'Young Xiao has a great future in martial arts. I wish you luck in your upcoming match.',27326),(29634,0,0,0,0,'I do not know why he decided to take the monastic path so late in life. It is not my place to ask. Such questions fall under the responsibility of our Spirit-Sage.',27326),(29633,0,0,0,0,'Zhi-Zhi\'s style is different than that of most pandaren monks. He and his kind tend to have more... energy... than us.',27326),(29632,0,0,0,0,'You may be a hero in your own lands, but here, you must prove your worth.',27326),(29620,0,0,0,0,'We will move on to the training soon enough, young $c. First, we must talk, and drink, and eat.$b$bThough I must say, I admire your discipline.',27326),(29619,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for the banquet? I can\'t wait.',27326),(29756,0,0,0,0,'Even the dead know hunger.',27326),(29753,0,0,0,0,'Do not fear for the spirits of the beasts - they will find peace here.',27326),(29752,0,0,0,0,'We mustn\'t forsake the wayward dead.',27326),(29750,0,0,0,0,'To think the mogu have continued training the Spiritclaws for all these years...$B$BDid you get the bottles?',27326),(29751,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the items we need for the ritual? We cannot guide these spirits back without them.',27326),(29749,0,0,0,0,'Spirit-binding! How can the mogu have been allowed to resume such a disgusting practice?! And now here I am, the product of a half-failed conjuring...$B$B<The spirit fumes for a moment, then turns to you.>$B$BWhat century is this?',0),(29926,0,0,0,0,'Never thought nibblers would be a big enough threat to choke up the whole mine.',27326),(29928,0,0,0,0,'<Mann looks at you expectantly, eyes wide and nostrils flared.>',27326),(29925,0,0,0,0,'Ah, hello again, $p! You received my message, then?',0),(31613,0,0,0,0,'Sprites, jade destroyers, rocks that talk. This world is becoming a troublesome one.$b$bBut... nothing that can not be solved with a strong brew and winning smile.$b$bAnd a solid punch or two.',27326),(29920,0,0,0,0,'Each of the pandriarchs earned their reputation in life and retained them afterward.  I can\'t even imagine how you will defeat them.',27326),(29881,0,0,0,0,'There is only a small window of time after each petal falls that it may be used to achieve the perfect hue.',27326)