k.',32638),(27157,0,0,0,0,'I need to get those drudges back to work.',32638),(27156,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not paying you to talk to me.  I\'m paying you to talk with my soldiers... and then fight with them.',32638),(27001,0,1,0,0,'I don\'t need you to kill the spiders... that\'s what these soldiers are for.  Think of it as killing two birds with one stone: we\'re getting rid of the spiders, and the recruits are getting valuable combat experience.',32638),(27013,0,0,0,0,'I have a family to raise, and I need to do whatever I can to protect them.',32638),(27000,0,1,0,0,'The spiders tend to be a little skittish.  One of the mustangs should be enough to scare them away.',32638),(26954,0,0,0,0,'Back so soon?',32638),(26956,0,0,0,0,'Have you finished killing... er, removing those plants yet?',32638),(26953,0,0,0,0,'Zen\'Kiki needs a... a big $g brother: sister;, like you, to help him gain some confidence.',32638),(26978,0,1,0,0,'I see you\'re still carrying some of those drums with you, $n.  Don\'t return until they\'ve all been placed.',32638),(26933,0,0,0,0,'For a bunch of combat-trained goons, they certainly have made some progress on that farm.',32638),(26387,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t get squeamish on me. I\'d be over there ripping open cocoons myself if I didn\'t have to keep all this equipment running.',32638),(26367,0,0,0,0,'Ongo\'longo still lies in chains.',32638),(26308,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll be quite busy if you want to spill as much blood as they have.',32638),(26307,0,0,0,0,'What are you waiting for?',32638),(26357,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t see enough lights burnin\', $c. Better get goin\'.',32638),(26306,0,0,0,0,'You\'d better not get cold feet on me.',32638),(26267,0,1,0,0,'Don\'t get caught offguard. Even if one slime doesn\'t seem like much, once one gets you pinned down... the others won\'t be far behind.',32638),(26224,0,5,0,0,'Clear your head of impure thoughts, $r. Become one with the wilds!',32638),(26223,0,5,0,0,'Show them the might of Revantusk!',32638),(26240,0,0,0,0,'Back so soo