ll lead to more victories on the front.',34769),(25255,0,6,0,0,'How goes the fight below?',34769),(25464,0,0,0,0,'Is it done yet, $n?',34769),(25323,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',34769),(25319,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',34769),(25574,0,0,0,0,'Is it done yet, $n?',34769),(26142,0,0,0,0,'I GROW WEAKER. YOU MUST DESTROY... MORE CONDUITS BEFORE... I DIE.',35435),(26133,0,1,0,0,'Not all of the fiends have been destroyed.',35435),(26130,0,25,0,0,'You must slay each of those ogre magi to stop their rituals and disconnect L\'ghorek from the one below.',35435),(26065,0,6,0,0,'Wil\'hai is still trapped.',35435),(26072,0,6,0,0,'Is the totem full?',35435),(26071,0,25,0,0,'Go back down there and kill more of those things.',35435),(25980,0,25,0,0,'First you need to kill Azrajar. Then, you take the pointy end of the banner and you stick it in him.',35435),(25974,0,1,0,0,'This isn\'t going to be easy, but when they\'re dead, we\'ll have ourselves a strong drink.$B$BRight?',35435),(26091,0,0,0,0,'Save my wolf, $n.',35435),(26089,0,0,0,0,'Kill those fish-men, $n.',35435),(26126,0,0,0,0,'We haven\'t found the right combination yet, $n.  Keep at it!  I\'m sure you can figure it out!',35435),(25951,0,1,0,0,'Stand with us, Battlemaiden. We shall not fall this day.',35435),(25629,0,0,0,0,'I dispatched my Honor Guard when the fighting broke out. They are better equipped to deal with the chaos of this kind of battle, and I am hardly in need of their aid.',35435),(25896,0,1,0,0,'The threat may not be sure, but the Kvaldir are certainly not fools. They would not return if they did not have some confidence in victory.$B$BThe sooner our allies are summoned, the better. Find my Tide Priestesses.',35435),(26135,0,1,0,0,'The ruins are surely still swarming with naga. Pay close attention to their patrols and I\'m sure you\'ll be able to slip through.',35435),(25972,0,1,0,0,'Those aren\'t trade ships, those are war ships. Still, this is an incredible stroke of luck. Fire that flare off and pray that they