ckly, before the rest of the naga find us.',35435),(25592,0,1,0,0,'I don\'t know how long the men up there can hold out. Between exhaustion, limited air, and those murlocs, they\'re going to get worn down quickly.',35435),(25993,0,0,0,0,'You\'d better keep trying, $n.  These naga aren\'t going anywhere unless you wake the creature up.',35435),(25990,0,0,0,0,'The ritual is not yet complete, $n.',35435),(25908,0,0,0,0,'<Duarn is too focused on his task to notice your presence.>',35435),(25907,0,0,0,0,'I need more time, $n...',35435),(25900,0,0,0,0,'Nespirah needs our help.  If nothing else, I can sense that.',35435),(25440,0,1,0,0,'Waiting on something? I thought you\'d appreciate the opportunity to handle this yourself.$B$BDid I misjudge you?',35435),(25439,0,0,0,0,'These naga have ignited a fire in me that is not easily quenched.',35435),(25441,0,1,0,0,'Yes, $r?',35435),(25360,0,1,0,0,'Careful. They pinch.',35435),(25215,0,0,0,0,'We are they prey to many of the creatures in these waters. We cannot let our guard down.',35435),(25220,0,1,0,0,'You look relatively intact. Have you finished?',35435),(25221,0,1,0,0,'Our other allies are in the cave below. Things look safe from here, but it\'s hard to be certain.$B$BDid you do as I asked of you?',35435),(25164,0,1,0,0,'Dey seem relentless, but we gonna turn dem back!',35435),(25334,0,1,0,0,'Lose yaself in the dancin\' flames. Come with me, deeper into Vashj\'ir, so that we be knowin\' the face of our enemy.',35435),(25883,0,0,0,0,'Have you destroyed the naga arsenal?',35435),(26008,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to rescue some of the imprisoned warriors, $n?',35435),(25884,0,0,0,0,'You fill the sea with naga blood yet, $r?',35435),(26040,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to find me any of their seaweed, $r?',35435),(25887,0,0,0,0,'With the naga numbers dramatically lessened, we shall be able to finish our destruction of this stronghold.',35435),(26007,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it, $r.$b$bThat\'s all I know...',35435),(25503,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve discovere