25,0,0,'Are you going to pull your fleshy weight, $r?',35662),(26499,0,1,0,0,'Rally more of our troops, $n.',35662),(27932,0,25,0,0,'We need more of those giants destroyed, $n.',35662),(27043,0,6,0,0,'Have you not managed to gain the elemental wards and defeat Haethen Kaul yet?',35662),(27747,0,6,0,0,'I trust you set the entire ridge aflame?',36322),(27929,0,6,0,0,'Have you helped clear the skies, $n?',36322),(27622,0,6,0,0,'Is my salvage expert still alive? More importantly... is my shredder?',36322),(27611,0,6,0,0,'How goes the defense of our beach head?',36322),(27610,0,0,0,0,'What\'s the state of the beach head, $n?',36322),(27606,0,1,0,0,'You want me to keep firing?$B$BI can keep firing.',36322),(27584,0,5,0,0,'After the battle we will mount their heads on pikes and build a wall all along the beach. THAT will show these belly-crawling SNAKES who owns the Highlands.',36322),(26830,0,6,0,0,'It is good to see you, $c. How goes the search?',36322),(26621,0,5,0,0,'Revolution, at last!$B$BThe Dragonmaw are finally undoing the shackles of the filth who have held us back!',36322),(26538,0,274,0,0,'Speak quickly! What do you want?$B$BDon\'t let the Warchief see us talking...',36322),(26374,0,6,0,0,'Have you found my missing troops?$B$BBe sure to search every filthy back-alley. If there\'s trouble, they\'ll find it.',36322),(26831,0,1,0,0,'It is good to see you on the battlefield again.',36322),(26832,0,1,0,0,'You\'ve not yet completed the task that I set upon you - I have no further words to offer you.',36322),(26829,0,1,0,0,'Our revenge against the worshipers of Deathwing has finally arrived. It is a sweet revenge.',36322),(26827,0,0,0,0,'',36322),(26583,0,1,0,0,'I cannot fit inside. Our elementals are not up to the task.$B$BYou must see this done.',36322),(26584,0,1,0,0,'Strangely, your size and resourcefulness are starting to prove quite useful.',36322),(26581,0,1,0,0,'The fighting at the temple has quieted since you left. Whatever impression you\'re making, it seems to have helped at least that much.',36322),(26579,0,1,0,0,'We have escaped the curse of flesh for this long; I will not see my brothers fall to such weaknesses now.',36322),(26578,0,0,0,0,'I am not yet convinced that you have more value than the filth I have sent you to cleanse.',36322),(26659,0,1,0,0,'This broodmother has taken wing over these stone drakes for nearly 300 years. She is quite strong, even for a stone dragon.',36322),(26657,0,0,0,0,'Look to the dragons that have been knocked out of the sky by boulders. They will be easier targets.',36322),(26656,0,0,0,0,'Did they make it, $c?',36322),(26575,0,0,0,0,'Rough times, these...',36322),(26439,0,0,0,0,'<Berracite grumbles, and you feel the reverberations gradually roll by under your feet.>',36322),(26438,0,0,0,0,'I do not know why the flayers hunger so. Many things have changed since the rift opened between our worlds.',36322),(26426,0,0,0,0,'',36322),(26375,0,0,0,0,'It is unbearable to watch. They know no mercy. They should be offered none.',36322),(26377,0,0,0,0,'BThey will learn respect for the earth...$B$BPiece by piece...$B$BRock by rock...$B$B...with time.',36322),(26376,0,1,0,0,'Take your time, fleshling.$B$BI am in no hurry.',36322),(26315,0,6,0,0,'Did ya confront Boden yet?',36322),(26314,0,0,0,0,'Did it work, mon?',36322),(26312,0,1,0,0,'Perhaps it was foolish of me to let dem be pressin\' out so far. Everythin\' I know of da earth elementals told me an attack like dis couldn\'t be lastin\'... dat dey were just lashin\' out in dere rage, and would be leavin\' just as quickly.$B$BIt be very clear now dat I was wrong.',36322),(26857,0,0,0,0,'Did you succeed, $n?',36322),(26861,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $n.  Are the gates closed?',36322),(26771,0,0,0,0,'It seems like the trap will work on Abyssion.',36322),(26261,0,0,0,0,'What have we discovered?',36322),(26258,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $n?',36322),(26254,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $n?',36322),(26251,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',36322),(26250,0,0,0,0,'Hail, $n.',36322),(26248,0,0,0,0,'The spirits always have something to say to those who will listen.',36322),(28404,0,0,0,0,'Almost got it...',36372),(28271,0,0,0,0,'How\'d it go out there, $n?',36372),(28352,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to tame some camels for me yet, $n?',36372),(28195,0,0,0,0,'Haf my orders been carried out, $r?',36372),(28193,0,0,0,0,'Vell, $r?$b$bVere zhe guests involved in zhe plot to haf me rubbed out?',36372),(27990,0,0,0,0,'Vell?$b$bHas our little situation been brought under control?',36372),(28002,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to but the guests\' minds at ease, $r?',36372),(27969,0,0,0,0,'Vhell, $r? Vere you... persvasive?',36372),(27926,0,0,0,0,'Well, hello again, $c.',36372),(28480,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $n.',36372),(27779,0,0,0,0,'The expedition members\' demise is unfortunate.',36372),(27778,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, user $n.',36372),(27761,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, user $n.  I am happy to see you are still unaffected by the effects of the expedition curse.',36372),(27755,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?  The expedition members cannot be saved.',36372),(28501,0,0,0,0,'There is no time to waste!',36372),(28499,0,1,0,0,'You\'re back, $n.  Is your prowess as great as I\'ve heard?',36372),(27900,0,0,0,0,'This guy\'s tougher than he looks - and he looks tough!',36372),(28277,0,0,0,0,'Did you see, $n?',36372),(28201,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $n.  How are the recruitment efforts faring?',36372),(27838,0,0,0,0,'Is it done yet, $n.',36372),(28611,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',36372),(27837,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $r.',36372),(27836,0,0,0,0,'Have you succeeded, $n?',36372),(27519,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for your help, $n.',36372),(27520,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back!',36372),(28250,0,0,0,0,'Did you do it, $n?',36372),(27431,0,0,0,0,'What have you found, $n?',36372),(27511,0,0,0,0,'Find anything interesting, $n?',36372),(28502,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $n.',36372),(28145,0,0,0,0,'Did you obtain it, $n?',36372),(28141,0,0,0,0,'Did you succeed?',36372),(28134,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, $n.  Have you completed the task I request of you?',36372),(27923,0,0,0,0,'Is it done, $n?',36372),(27922,0,0,0,0,'What did you witness, $n?',36372),(28591,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a wonder they haven\'t hit the big collection of explosive gas above us yet. ',36372),(28589,0,15,0,0,'Whatsa matter? You go blind? Can\'t you see we\'re still being creamed here?$B$BGet back on one of those cannons and pulverize those Wildhammer!',36372),(28586,0,0,0,0,'Maybe you\'d be willing to fly back down there and rescue a few more of our laborers?',36372),(28584,0,6,0,0,'Look, I\'m just a simple cartographer, but according to my estimates, not to mention what my eyes are telling me, there are a few more faulty valves that need to be sealed.',36372),(28588,0,5,0,0,'What? That\'s all you\'ve killed?$B$BGet back out there and take care of the rest!',36372),(27745,5,0,0,0,'$n!',0),(27743,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s take care of a few more of them, okay?',36372),(27661,0,34,0,0,'Lord Cannon\'s not dead. I\'d know if he were.',36372),(27703,0,6,0,0,'That\'s all? I think that you can finish off a few more.',36372),(27701,0,396,0,0,'All you have to do is use the axe to break Lirastrasza\'s chains.',36372),(27662,0,6,0,0,'Try a few more, would ya?',36372),(27659,0,1,0,0,'We need those portals shutdown and their ascendant guardians slain, $c.',36372),(27689,0,274,0,0,'They\'re not all dead yet now are they?',36372),(27655,0,396,0,0,'Go back and kill more.',36372),(27491,0,25,0,0,'I need you to get those Kor\'kon assassins safely to their destination, $n.',36372),(27497,0,1,0,0,'We need those buildings to be marked if our bombardment is to be effective.',36372),(27493,0,6,0,0,'There are more to be killed, $r. You do have the stomach for that, yes?',36372),(27863,0,1,0,0,'No payout until the fight\'s over, $g man:lady;.',36372),(28170,0,274,0,0,'Don\'t fear de darkness, mon.',36372),(28151,0,6,0,0,'How is your disguise holding up? And what\'s happening with those ogres?',36372),(28133,0,1,0,0,'Our dominance over the dragons is both our strength and our curse. Their wrath is a terrible thing to behold.',36372),(28175,0,1,0,0,'The black flight may never be redeemed, but in the wake of all of their destruction, there is always hope for life anew.',36372),(28173,0,1,0,0,'Trust me, I know how distasteful it sounds. We have a grim task ahead of us, but tenderness and sympathy must be put aside in these moments... for the sake of all life.',36372),(28191,0,0,0,0,'There is more that must be done...',36372),(28094,0,0,0,0,'Not done yet, bucko.',36372),(28091,0,1,0,0,'There are still some guards left down there. Finish\'m off.',36372),(27509,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the breach?',36372),(27507,0,1,0,0,'It was inevitable I suppose. We\'ve kept them out for far longer than I thought we could. They were sure to find a way eventually.',36372),(27506,0,6,0,0,'Have you done as I asked?',36372),(27505,0,25,0,0,'Keep the menders safe as they heal our wounded dragons!',36372),(27300,0,1,0,0,'All over da highlands, da Twilight pervert da elements and turn dem against us. We\'ve witnessed unbearable horrors at dey\'re hands. I\'m eager to see dem slaughtered.',36372),(27299,0,6,0,0,'Did ya have any luck with dose tentacles?',36372),(27955,0,6,0,0,'What did the Eye show you?',36372),(27951,0,0,0,0,'I have been watching you, $r.',36372);
